      "writtenOn": "2023-09-12T05:10:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I thought of not adding a signature payload in CoseSign1 for KESignature. Because ideally, each party should compute session_id on their own and verify the other party\u0027s signature on it.\nBut session_id is added in the returned result, so that it can be used by the key agreement orchestrator to compare the session ids returned by the two parties and decide whether the key agreement was successful at the end of `finish`.",
